  {
   "id": "heaven-seeker-the-savior-of-this-cruel-world-304554@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "heaven-seeker-the-savior-of-this-cruel-world-304554",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-07-12T06:56:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, this is the HEAVEN SEEKER development team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today, we released Ver1.0.2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please see below for the details of the fixes and adjustments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "・Fixed issues where some achievements could not be obtained",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "\"Unlock All Skills\": If the conditions are already met, the achievement will be unlocked upon entering the entrance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Retain Coins\": The achievement will be unlocked by meeting the specified conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "・Fixed the following issues with the Grimoire \"Thunder\"",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The default trajectory of Thunder was not normal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "It was always treated as the minimum value regardless of the accuracy status.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "When the side book \"Burst Bullet\" is applied, a shadow of Thunder may occur.: ・Fixed the following issues with the side book \"Chain Spell\":",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If already hopped with the effect of the side book \"Hopper Spell\" before chaining, it could not hop again after chaining.: ・Fixed the issue where the effect of the artifact \"Dodge Manual III\" was not working correctly.: ・Fixed the following issues with the artifacts \"Golden Magic Clock\" and \"Silver Magic Clock\":",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not registered in the encyclopedia even when obtained.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disappearing from the inventory when moving areas after acquisition.: ・Fixed the issue where the number of bombs obtained by artifact effects exceeded the limit:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The maximum number is now 10, just like normal bomb acquisition, and will not exceed this limit.: ・Fixed the issue where the beam shot by enemies had a larger hitbox than it appeared.: ・Fixed the issue where combos did not increase when defeating the enemy \"Devil in the box\".: ・Fixed the issue where rewards could appear during the defeat sequence of the boss in Area 4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "・Fixed the following UI issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Able to enter the dungeon while displaying the difficulty UI by interacting again during the dungeon entry sequence.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tooltips in the inventory (item information) could go off-screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Mana Consumption Correction\" displayed twice in the Grimoire calibration effects section when a side book is applied.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dice possession display misaligns when obtaining dice continuously in a short period.: ・Fixed the issue where setting \"Slow + Shot\" in key configuration made the operation non-functional.: ・Fixed the issue where Japanese appeared in the English version during the judgment room.: ・Adjusted to reduce the occurrence of forced termination.: ・Relaxed the activation conditions for dodging, making inputs easier to accept.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "・Adjusted some game balance",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Mana consumption correction status has been adjusted.: ・Adjusted the text of some side books.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
